{
  "_comment": [
    "Source of truth for which environment variables each Railway service gets.",
    "Consumed by scripts/push_railway_variables.py (push + --check). NOT Terraform:",
    "the terraform-community-providers/railway variable resources (railway_variable /",
    "railway_variable_collection) are unreliable at this scale (per-variable redeploys",
    "trip Railway's deploy rate limit; the collection resource's post-write read-back",
    "races on large services). GitHub Actions secrets/variables ARE still Terraform-",
    "managed (see github-ci.tf).",
    "",
    "Each leaf value is a KEY in secrets/{shared,staging,production}.tfvars -- the push",
    "script resolves it there (per-env file wins). An empty / missing tfvars value is",
    "skipped (Railway does not store empty variables). Reference strings stay as",
    "\"$${{ ... }}\" in the tfvars (HCL escaping, carried over) and are un-escaped to",
    "\"${{ ... }}\" before being sent to Railway."
  ],
